{"name":"-31-2B4-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"spark","raw":"火花"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunkill","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In the theater ravaged by intense fighting."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Battle","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unbelievable... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sangvis Dolls have grown even more powerful than before! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Is that a new model?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At least that particular Doll has never been sighted before. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There are no records concerning her in my database, so she could be a new model. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She must have exploited a loophole in the White Faction's defenses to have brought so many Sangvis units into the city."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even so, isn't this way too many? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange just said they're not doing well, so M4 could be having trouble too. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In any case...this fight is almost over. We'd better get ready."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Mercurows","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"